      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Gimli, MB. Sunday matinee show  Established in 2013, the name Ship &amp; Plough Tavern is a nod to the fishers and farmers who settled the Interlake region of Manitoba. We're located in Treaty 1 territory on the beautiful  shores of Lake Winnipeg."
      }
